        * `digitalWrite(emergencyStopPin, LOW)`:  Sets the emergency stop pin to LOW (or ground), effectively disabling the button.
        * `digitalWrite(emergencyStopPin, HIGH)`: Sets the emergency stop pin to HIGH, enabling the button.
        * The code reads a command from the serial monitor and toggles the emergency stop pin accordingly.

